{# What the server adds to the collaborative drawing app's <head> as it sends
   it: the design system, for the toolbar it puts above the app, and the
   painter's light/dark choice, applied before anything paints. The app is a
   built page served as a file, so it cannot include these itself.
   --oeee-chrome-top tells the app how far below the top of the window it
   starts (frontend/collaborate/app.css). #}
{% include "theme_head.jinja" %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/static/ds.css' | cachebuster | safe }}" />
<style>
  :root { --oeee-chrome-top: 53px; }
  body { margin: 0; }
</style>
